  ('class7-arts-en-ch2-p17-q2-2', 'class7-arts-en', 'class7-arts-en-ch2', 17, 2, 'He is not only a painter but also an inventor of many modern scientific discoveries write whatever you know about the person.'),
  ('class7-arts-en-ch2-p17-q3', 'class7-arts-en', 'class7-arts-en-ch2', 17, 3, 'Who drew the painting `Madonna of the Meadow? [picture: Raphael''s ''Madonna'' — a veiled woman holding a child cheek to cheek, reproduced on page 16] a. Gogh b. Raphael c. Matis d. Michelangelo'),
