  ('class7-arts-en-ch2-p17-q4', 'class7-arts-en', 'class7-arts-en-ch2', 17, 4, 'The first picture drawn by primitive people was discovered ---probably a. 10 thousand years ago. b. 20 thousand years ago. C. 30 thousand years ago. d. 40 thousand years ago.'),
  ('class7-arts-en-ch2-p17-q4-2', 'class7-arts-en', 'class7-arts-en-ch2', 17, 4, '"The subject of drawing pictures is properly arranged"- which artist made this invaluable invention? What do you know about him?'),
  ('class7-arts-en-ch2-p17-q5', 'class7-arts-en', 'class7-arts-en-ch2', 17, 5, 'The cave Al Tamira is- a. In France b. In Spain C. In Germany d. In Japan'),
