ঘ. মা শিশুকে অর্ধচন্দ্র দেখাচ্ছে।'),
  ('class7-bekoron-en-ch11-p111-q1', 'class7-bekoron-en', 'class7-bekoron-en-ch11', 111, 1, 'Students are the source of future hope and strength of our country. Much depends on how they spend their time and energy now. They have, in the first place, to acquire knowledge and experience. Secondly, they have to look around and study the condition of people, their ways of living and see in what direction reforms are necessary.'),
  ('class7-bekoron-en-ch11-p111-q2', 'class7-bekoron-en', 'class7-bekoron-en-ch11', 111, 2, 'No person can be happy without friends. The heart is formed for love and cannot be happy without the opportunity of giving and receiving affection. But you also cannot find others to love you unless you love them. Love is only to be obtained by giving love in return. You cannot be happy without it.'),
  ('class7-bekoron-en-ch11-p111-q3', 'class7-bekoron-en', 'class7-bekoron-en-ch11', 111, 3, 'A patriot is a man who loves his country. Works for it and is willing to fight and die for it. Every soldier is bound to do his duty. But the best soldiers do more than this. They risk their lives because they love the country. They are the best friends of the people.'),
  ('class7-bekoron-en-ch2-p11-q1', 'class7-bekoron-en', 'class7-bekoron-en-ch2', 11, 1, 'ব্যাকরণকে ভাষার কী বলা হয়?
