  ('class7-bgs-en-ch1-p16-q4', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch1', 16, 4, 'Rimi was attentively watching a television program. In one scene, a leader, with a strong voice, declared support for implementing a political decision at a gathering of students and teachers. The students protested with shouts of “No, no.”
