  ('class7-bgs-en-ch10-p102-q2a', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch10', 102, NULL, 'Event 1: Mr. Shafiul went on vacation to a Southeast Asian country. The country is surrounded by the sea, and its natural scenery is truly charming. Though the country consists of islands, four islands play the key role in the economy. Event 2: Mr. Muaz has been working in an East Asian country for a long time. Though the country is one of the most populous in the world, it is economically quite developed.
