  ('class7-bgs-en-ch3-p33-t1', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch3', 33, NULL, 'Coordination of roles of different family members is the best of means to the proper socialisation of children- Show logic in group discussion.'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch3-p34-q1', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch3', 34, 1, 'Explain the concept of a changing family.'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch3-p34-q1a', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch3', 34, NULL, 'Mehrima and Mubasshira are friends. Mubasshira lives with her parents and younger brother. When she visits Mehrima’s house, she sees a large dining table where uncles, aunts, and grandparents eat together. After the meal, they listen to stories from grandmother. Mubasshira enjoys the experience.
a. What is socialisation?'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch3-p34-q1b', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch3', 34, NULL, 'Mehrima and Mubasshira are friends. Mubasshira lives with her parents and younger brother. When she visits Mehrima’s house, she sees a large dining table where uncles, aunts, and grandparents eat together. After the meal, they listen to stories from grandmother. Mubasshira enjoys the experience.
b. How does socialisation initially start through the mother?'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch3-p34-q1c', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch3', 34, NULL, 'Mehrima and Mubasshira are friends. Mubasshira lives with her parents and younger brother. When she visits Mehrima’s house, she sees a large dining table where uncles, aunts, and grandparents eat together. After the meal, they listen to stories from grandmother. Mubasshira enjoys the experience.
c. Explain the type of family Mubasshira belongs to.'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch3-p34-q1d', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch3', 34, NULL, 'Mehrima and Mubasshira are friends. Mubasshira lives with her parents and younger brother. When she visits Mehrima’s house, she sees a large dining table where uncles, aunts, and grandparents eat together. After the meal, they listen to stories from grandmother. Mubasshira enjoys the experience.
d. Do you think Mehrima and Mubasshira are being socialised in the same way? Support your answer.'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch3-p34-q2', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch3', 34, 2, 'Why are today’s children not developing a sense of generosity?'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch3-p34-q3', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch3', 34, 3, 'Faruk and Hasib are in the same class. Hasib often goes out with his parents and is always cheerful. On the other hand, Faruk does not mingle with anyone and looks gloomy in class. His parents are separated, and he lives with his mother.
What is the reason for the behavioural difference between Faruk and Hasib?
a. Relationship among family members
b. Educational environment
c. Behaviour of classmates
d. Relationship between child and family'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch3-p34-q3s', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch3', 34, 3, 'How is a child''s socialisation being hindered?'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch3-p34-q4', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch3', 34, 4, 'Faruk and Hasib are in the same class. Hasib often goes out with his parents and is always cheerful. On the other hand, Faruk does not mingle with anyone and looks gloomy in class. His parents are separated, and he lives with his mother.
What kind of behaviour might Faruk show in the future?
a. Avoid friends
b. Attend school regularly
c. Help classmates.
d. Be empathetic to others'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch4-p37-t1', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch4', 37, NULL, 'Describe one informal economic activity of your region. Discuss how it contributes to the national economy.'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch4-p40-t1', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch4', 40, NULL, 'Mention one of the names of small, medium, large or cottage industries of the country and discuss its importance in our national economy.'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch4-p40-t2', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch4', 40, NULL, 'Discuss in brief the future prospects of industry in Bangladesh'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch4-p41-t1', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch4', 41, NULL, 'Make a list of export and import goods of Bangladesh.'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch4-p41-t2', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch4', 41, NULL, 'Write some sentences about the importance of export and import.'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch4-p43-q1', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch4', 43, 1, 'Which country is the largest buyer of Bangladesh’s manufactured products, including garments?
