  ('class7-bgs-en-ch4-p43-t2', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch4', 43, NULL, 'Identify the problems in agro-product processing industries.'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch4-p44-q1a', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch4', 44, NULL, 'Tamiz Uddin cultivates various crops like rice, wheat, mustard, and corn on his own land with his three sons. His wife and daughters-in-law help with harvesting. In his free time, he runs a grocery shop. His younger brother, Ramiz Uddin, works in a garment factory, and his wife is a government primary school teacher.
a. What is the full form of SAFTA?'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch4-p44-q1b', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch4', 44, NULL, 'Tamiz Uddin cultivates various crops like rice, wheat, mustard, and corn on his own land with his three sons. His wife and daughters-in-law help with harvesting. In his free time, he runs a grocery shop. His younger brother, Ramiz Uddin, works in a garment factory, and his wife is a government primary school teacher.
b. What is meant by medium industry? Explain.'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch4-p44-q1c', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch4', 44, NULL, 'Tamiz Uddin cultivates various crops like rice, wheat, mustard, and corn on his own land with his three sons. His wife and daughters-in-law help with harvesting. In his free time, he runs a grocery shop. His younger brother, Ramiz Uddin, works in a garment factory, and his wife is a government primary school teacher.
c. What type of economic activity are Ramiz Uddin and his wife involved in? Explain.'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch4-p44-q4', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch4', 44, 4, 'The main problems of the processing industry are—
