ii. Low export demand
iii. Capital shortage
Which of the following is correct?
a. i and ii
b. i and iii
c. ii and iii
d. i, ii, and iii'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch4-p44-q5', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch4', 44, 5, 'Mr. Rakib is an industrialist. He has set up a garment factory in Dhaka with an investment of 20 crore taka. Approximately 200 female workers are employed at his factory.
What type of industry is Mr. Rakib’s factory?
a. Cottage industry
b. Small industry
c. Medium industry
d. Large industry'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch4-p44-q6', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch4', 44, 6, 'Mr. Rakib is an industrialist. He has set up a garment factory in Dhaka with an investment of 20 crore taka. Approximately 200 female workers are employed at his factory.
