d. High birth & high death rate'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch7-p76-q4', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch7', 76, 4, 'Fauzia, a social worker, has been working in Noyonpur village for five years. There, girls are married off right after finishing grade five. A recent survey showed that 50 babies were born and five died within a year in Noyonpur.
