  ('class7-bgs-en-ch7-p77-q2', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch7', 77, 2, 'Explain any two causes of child mortality in Bangladesh.'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch7-p77-q2a', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch7', 77, NULL, 'Event 1: The Chowdhury family and the Halder family are known to many in the Kulaura area of Sylhet as successful business families. Yet, the Chowdhurys’ ancestral home is in Kishoreganj and the Halder family’s original home is in Brahmanbaria. Event 2: Many people from three to four adjacent villages including Saidpur and Sohagi have been living in the Middle East with their families for about 15 years. Many of their children have never seen the birthplace of their ancestors.
a. What is the crude birth rate?'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch7-p77-q2b', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch7', 77, NULL, 'Event 1: The Chowdhury family and the Halder family are known to many in the Kulaura area of Sylhet as successful business families. Yet, the Chowdhurys’ ancestral home is in Kishoreganj and the Halder family’s original home is in Brahmanbaria. Event 2: Many people from three to four adjacent villages including Saidpur and Sohagi have been living in the Middle East with their families for about 15 years. Many of their children have never seen the birthplace of their ancestors.
b. Explain one reason for the increase in the average life expectancy of people in Bangladesh.'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch7-p77-q2c', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch7', 77, NULL, 'Event 1: The Chowdhury family and the Halder family are known to many in the Kulaura area of Sylhet as successful business families. Yet, the Chowdhurys’ ancestral home is in Kishoreganj and the Halder family’s original home is in Brahmanbaria. Event 2: Many people from three to four adjacent villages including Saidpur and Sohagi have been living in the Middle East with their families for about 15 years. Many of their children have never seen the birthplace of their ancestors.
c. What type of migration is described in event-1? Explain.'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch7-p77-q2d', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch7', 77, NULL, 'Event 1: The Chowdhury family and the Halder family are known to many in the Kulaura area of Sylhet as successful business families. Yet, the Chowdhurys’ ancestral home is in Kishoreganj and the Halder family’s original home is in Brahmanbaria. Event 2: Many people from three to four adjacent villages including Saidpur and Sohagi have been living in the Middle East with their families for about 15 years. Many of their children have never seen the birthplace of their ancestors.
d. Do you agree with the statement “The migration described in event-2 is a key reason for the reduction in the country’s population growth rate”? Give arguments in support of your answer.'),
