  ('class7-bgs-en-ch8-p84-q1a', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch8', 84, NULL, 'Zahid is the only child of a conservative family. During his marriage, his parents wanted to take valuable gifts and 5 lakh taka from the bride’s family for business purposes, but Zahid refused. He explained that he couldn''t accept or support such actions. His parents realised their mistake.
a. What is child marriage?'),
