  ('class7-bgs-en-ch8-p84-q2', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch8', 84, 2, 'How does dowry undermine women’s dignity?'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch8-p84-q3', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch8', 84, 3, 'Mr. Mizan gave a motorcycle to the groom at his daughter Mariam’s wedding. A few days later, Mariam’s in-laws sent her back to her father’s house to bring more money. When she failed to do so, they subjected her to physical and mental abuse.
