  ('class7-bgs-en-ch9-p93-q3', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch9', 93, 3, 'Rozina asked her husband to bring toys for their children. He brought a cricket bat and ball for their son, and dolls and toy kitchenware for their daughter.
