ii. Difference in perspective
iii. Difference in affection
Which of the following is correct?
a. i
b. ii
c. ii and iii
d. i, ii and iii'),
  ('class7-bgs-en-ch9-p93-q4', 'class7-bgs-en', 'class7-bgs-en-ch9', 93, 4, 'Rozina asked her husband to bring toys for their children. He brought a cricket bat and ball for their son, and dolls and toy kitchenware for their daughter.
