  ('class7-christian-en-ch1-p7-q3', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch1', 7, 3, 'Stimulus: Dip is a pious person. He goes to ''A'' place to preach the word. There he discovers a person who is involved with drug addiction and all other unsocial activities and is also physically sick. By his prayer, service and preaching Dip heals their physical and mental illness.
Who inspired Dip to do the above work?
a. Peter
b. Jesus
c. Paul
d. John'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch1-p7-q4', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch1', 7, 4, 'Stimulus: Dip is a pious person. He goes to ''A'' place to preach the word. There he discovers a person who is involved with drug addiction and all other unsocial activities and is also physically sick. By his prayer, service and preaching Dip heals their physical and mental illness.
Through the works of Dip, people of “A” can receive –
i. new life
ii. service
iii. love
Which of the following is correct?
a. i & ii
b. ii & iii
c. i & iii
d. i, ii & iii'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch1-p8-q1', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch1', 8, 1, 'Why did God create human beings in His image?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch1-p8-q1a', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch1', 8, NULL, 'Stimulus: Jui is engaged to Dany. Although poor, Dany was pious, God-fearing and humble. He worked in a factory at a poor salary. He thought of himself as unworthy husband for his wife. So he wanted to leave his wife secretly. He went to the priest and told everything. But the priest told Dany about Jui, "Jui is a simple, humble and devout girl. Do not be afraid to accept Jui as your wife." Dany did as the priest advised him.
a. What is the name of the king of Judea?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch1-p8-q1b', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch1', 8, NULL, 'Stimulus: Jui is engaged to Dany. Although poor, Dany was pious, God-fearing and humble. He worked in a factory at a poor salary. He thought of himself as unworthy husband for his wife. So he wanted to leave his wife secretly. He went to the priest and told everything. But the priest told Dany about Jui, "Jui is a simple, humble and devout girl. Do not be afraid to accept Jui as your wife." Dany did as the priest advised him.
b. Why did God send His beloved Son in the womb of Mary?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch1-p8-q1c', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch1', 8, NULL, 'Stimulus: Jui is engaged to Dany. Although poor, Dany was pious, God-fearing and humble. He worked in a factory at a poor salary. He thought of himself as unworthy husband for his wife. So he wanted to leave his wife secretly. He went to the priest and told everything. But the priest told Dany about Jui, "Jui is a simple, humble and devout girl. Do not be afraid to accept Jui as your wife." Dany did as the priest advised him.
c. What aspects of Joseph can be found in Dany - Explain.'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch1-p8-q1d', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch1', 8, NULL, 'Stimulus: Jui is engaged to Dany. Although poor, Dany was pious, God-fearing and humble. He worked in a factory at a poor salary. He thought of himself as unworthy husband for his wife. So he wanted to leave his wife secretly. He went to the priest and told everything. But the priest told Dany about Jui, "Jui is a simple, humble and devout girl. Do not be afraid to accept Jui as your wife." Dany did as the priest advised him.
d. The stimulus has some similarities with the story of Joseph? Justify your comment.'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch1-p8-q2', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch1', 8, 2, 'What kind of man was Mary’s husband?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch1-p8-q2a', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch1', 8, NULL, 'Stimulus: Proshanto is a social worker in an area. He is very pious in his personal and family life. He helps the poor of the village by giving them medicine, cloth and food. The villagers introduced the great heart of Prashanto, and they started bringing patients to him so that he could heal the patients. He told the villagers, “I can''t do this, only Jesus can do this.”
a. What is the meaning of the word ‘Messiah’?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch1-p8-q2b', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch1', 8, NULL, 'Stimulus: Proshanto is a social worker in an area. He is very pious in his personal and family life. He helps the poor of the village by giving them medicine, cloth and food. The villagers introduced the great heart of Prashanto, and they started bringing patients to him so that he could heal the patients. He told the villagers, “I can''t do this, only Jesus can do this.”
b. Why is Jesus addressed as ‘Lord’?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch1-p8-q2c', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch1', 8, NULL, 'Stimulus: Proshanto is a social worker in an area. He is very pious in his personal and family life. He helps the poor of the village by giving them medicine, cloth and food. The villagers introduced the great heart of Prashanto, and they started bringing patients to him so that he could heal the patients. He told the villagers, “I can''t do this, only Jesus can do this.”
c. Why did Prashanto express his inability to heal the patients? Explain.'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch1-p8-q2d', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch1', 8, NULL, 'Stimulus: Proshanto is a social worker in an area. He is very pious in his personal and family life. He helps the poor of the village by giving them medicine, cloth and food. The villagers introduced the great heart of Prashanto, and they started bringing patients to him so that he could heal the patients. He told the villagers, “I can''t do this, only Jesus can do this.”
d. Do you think all qualities of Jesus are evident in Proshanto? Justify your comment.'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch1-p8-q3', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch1', 8, 3, 'Why Mary is called ‘blessed among women’?'),
