  ('class7-christian-en-ch2-p15-q1a', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch2', 15, NULL, 'Stimulus: Apurbo has build up a beautiful farm. There are cows, different types of birds, swans and chickens, plants and a garden of different kinds of flowers. He takes care of all these with sincerity and affection. He laboriously works for the development of the farm. He earns much money by selling milk from cows and flowers of the garden. He helps the poor after fulfilling his own needs.
