  ('class7-christian-en-ch2-p15-q4', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch2', 15, 4, 'Stimulus: Asim earns a lot of money by indiscriminately cutting down forest trees to make and sell various types of furniture. People decorate their homes and enjoy luxury and comfort using his products. However, the waste from his factory pollutes the nearby river. A devout person called Asim said, “This kind of mindset is not beneficial for you or others. Proper education can bring a change in your attitude.”
