  ('class7-christian-en-ch2-p16-q2a', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch2', 16, NULL, 'Stimulus: Scenario-1: Going to a study tour Seema saw the ‘Shalbon’ in Modhupur area very beautifully decorated, chirping of birds being echoed. Scenery and environment of ‘Shalbon’ captivated Seema.
