  ('class7-christian-en-ch3-p27-q3', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch3', 27, 3, 'Stimulus: Gautam and Joakim are good friends. Both are devoted to God. Joakim always sits back in the classroom and hesitates to answer the teacher’s questions. But Gautam is the opposite. Observing Joakim’s situation, Gautam comes forward to help him. Later, Joakim participates in the school debate competition.
