  ('class7-christian-en-ch3-p28-q2a', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch3', 28, NULL, 'Stimulus: Sourav is the only son of his parents. But he is not normal like others. He is physically impaired. He has profound belief upon God. He prays to God seeking strength so that he can do his own work. As a result he makes a good result in the exam. He obtains government scholarship. On the contrary, his friend Palash suffers from mental anxiety due to his color being black though he is physically fit. He cannot focus on any task. Due to mental stress he becomes sick.
