  ('class7-christian-en-ch5-p45-q3', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch5', 45, 3, 'Stimulus: The preachers of rural area teach children about sacrament, so that they can differentiate good and evil and change their mind. The priests usually go once to remote villages for preaching. Then Himel was eager to accept sacrament. Later he was accepted with the sacrament of the church.
