a. confession of sin
b. communion
c. baptism
d. Intervention'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch5-p46-q1a', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch5', 46, NULL, 'Stimulus: Anol is a preacher. Since childhood, he has been deeply interested in religion. He takes part in all religious activities before anyone else. While doing ministry work, he faces criticism, hatred, and humiliation from people. Still, he carries out his work gracefully because he knows that to do something good, one has to endure hardship– sometimes even neglect from loved ones. His childhood religious education inspired him to stay focused. As a result, he has become a faithful servant of God and a free person.
a. Who were the first witnesses of the birth of Jesus?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch5-p46-q1b', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch5', 46, NULL, 'Stimulus: Anol is a preacher. Since childhood, he has been deeply interested in religion. He takes part in all religious activities before anyone else. While doing ministry work, he faces criticism, hatred, and humiliation from people. Still, he carries out his work gracefully because he knows that to do something good, one has to endure hardship– sometimes even neglect from loved ones. His childhood religious education inspired him to stay focused. As a result, he has become a faithful servant of God and a free person.
b. Why was Jesus born in a stable?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch5-p46-q1c', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch5', 46, NULL, 'Stimulus: Anol is a preacher. Since childhood, he has been deeply interested in religion. He takes part in all religious activities before anyone else. While doing ministry work, he faces criticism, hatred, and humiliation from people. Still, he carries out his work gracefully because he knows that to do something good, one has to endure hardship– sometimes even neglect from loved ones. His childhood religious education inspired him to stay focused. As a result, he has become a faithful servant of God and a free person.
c. Whose characteristics inspired Anol in his work? Explain.'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch5-p46-q1d', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch5', 46, NULL, 'Stimulus: Anol is a preacher. Since childhood, he has been deeply interested in religion. He takes part in all religious activities before anyone else. While doing ministry work, he faces criticism, hatred, and humiliation from people. Still, he carries out his work gracefully because he knows that to do something good, one has to endure hardship– sometimes even neglect from loved ones. His childhood religious education inspired him to stay focused. As a result, he has become a faithful servant of God and a free person.
d. Do you think Anol has done works worthy of God’s grace? Give reasons to support your answer.'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch5-p46-q4', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch5', 46, 4, 'Stimulus: The preachers of rural area teach children about sacrament, so that they can differentiate good and evil and change their mind. The priests usually go once to remote villages for preaching. Then Himel was eager to accept sacrament. Later he was accepted with the sacrament of the church.
