c. i & iii
d. i, ii & iii'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch5-p47-q1', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch5', 47, 1, 'What kind of life did the Virgin Mary live?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch5-p47-q2', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch5', 47, 2, 'Why did Jesus come to the world?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch5-p47-q2a', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch5', 47, NULL, 'Stimulus: Placid is a social worker. He is working with others for the development of society. Everyone of his locality knows about his honesty, faithfulness and justice. A friend of him wanted to testify his honesty. So he insisted him to stop his social activities and offered him a lot of money. But Placid ignored him. And he continued his work strongly and appointed more workers, so that they can continue his work in absence of him.
a. By whom was Jesus baptized?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch5-p47-q2b', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch5', 47, NULL, 'Stimulus: Placid is a social worker. He is working with others for the development of society. Everyone of his locality knows about his honesty, faithfulness and justice. A friend of him wanted to testify his honesty. So he insisted him to stop his social activities and offered him a lot of money. But Placid ignored him. And he continued his work strongly and appointed more workers, so that they can continue his work in absence of him.
b. What happens to a man after his baptism?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch5-p47-q2c', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch5', 47, NULL, 'Stimulus: Placid is a social worker. He is working with others for the development of society. Everyone of his locality knows about his honesty, faithfulness and justice. A friend of him wanted to testify his honesty. So he insisted him to stop his social activities and offered him a lot of money. But Placid ignored him. And he continued his work strongly and appointed more workers, so that they can continue his work in absence of him.
c. By which event of Jesus was Placid encouraged and won the temptation? Explain.'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch5-p47-q2d', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch5', 47, NULL, 'Stimulus: Placid is a social worker. He is working with others for the development of society. Everyone of his locality knows about his honesty, faithfulness and justice. A friend of him wanted to testify his honesty. So he insisted him to stop his social activities and offered him a lot of money. But Placid ignored him. And he continued his work strongly and appointed more workers, so that they can continue his work in absence of him.
d. Jesus’ calling of disciples and Placid’s appointment of workers– compare and contrast these two incidents.'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch5-p47-q3', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch5', 47, 3, 'What was the main theme of the preaching of John the Baptist?'),
