  ('class7-christian-en-ch6-p55-q3', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch6', 55, 3, 'Stimulus: Flora is a very pious woman and a woman of principle. Her only son is mentally retarded. Flora always took care of her child and prayed to God. One day this mentally retarded child became a leading artist. His fame spread at home and abroad.
The quality of virgin Mary that is depicted in Flora is– in God.
a. Dependency
b. Deep faith
c. Love
d. Piety'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch6-p56-q1', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch6', 56, 1, 'What kind of life did the virgin Mary live?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch6-p56-q1a', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch6', 56, NULL, 'Stimulus: Shanta is a student of class Seven. She is religious, truthful and just. On the occasion of Easter a function is held in the field beside the school. The responsibility was given to Shanta. On the day of the function some strayed youths started to make disturbance to stop the function. Many participants fled away. Thinking about the instruction of the Headmaster Shanta carried on the function. At this time the Bengali teacher encouraged and cooperated with her. At this time the thought of Virgin Mary came to her mind.
a. How was the life style of the Virgin Mary?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch6-p56-q1b', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch6', 56, NULL, 'Stimulus: Shanta is a student of class Seven. She is religious, truthful and just. On the occasion of Easter a function is held in the field beside the school. The responsibility was given to Shanta. On the day of the function some strayed youths started to make disturbance to stop the function. Many participants fled away. Thinking about the instruction of the Headmaster Shanta carried on the function. At this time the Bengali teacher encouraged and cooperated with her. At this time the thought of Virgin Mary came to her mind.
b. How can we show piety to Virgin Mary?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch6-p56-q1c', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch6', 56, NULL, 'Stimulus: Shanta is a student of class Seven. She is religious, truthful and just. On the occasion of Easter a function is held in the field beside the school. The responsibility was given to Shanta. On the day of the function some strayed youths started to make disturbance to stop the function. Many participants fled away. Thinking about the instruction of the Headmaster Shanta carried on the function. At this time the Bengali teacher encouraged and cooperated with her. At this time the thought of Virgin Mary came to her mind.
c. Explain Which quality of the Virgin Mary was reflected in Shanta?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch6-p56-q1d', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch6', 56, NULL, 'Stimulus: Shanta is a student of class Seven. She is religious, truthful and just. On the occasion of Easter a function is held in the field beside the school. The responsibility was given to Shanta. On the day of the function some strayed youths started to make disturbance to stop the function. Many participants fled away. Thinking about the instruction of the Headmaster Shanta carried on the function. At this time the Bengali teacher encouraged and cooperated with her. At this time the thought of Virgin Mary came to her mind.
d. Analyze the cause of Shanta''s remembering Mary because of the role of the Bengali teacher.'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch6-p56-q2', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch6', 56, 2, 'Why did God choose Mary to be the mother of Jesus?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch6-p56-q3', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch6', 56, 3, 'What was Mary’s relationship with Jesus like?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch6-p56-q4', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch6', 56, 4, 'Stimulus: Flora is a very pious woman and a woman of principle. Her only son is mentally retarded. Flora always took care of her child and prayed to God. One day this mentally retarded child became a leading artist. His fame spread at home and abroad.
