b. ii & iii
c. i & iii
d. i, ii & iii'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch7-p58-t1', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch7', 58, NULL, 'Write down the characters of worldly Kingdom and the Kingdom of God side by side in two columns.'),
