d. i, ii & iii'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch7-p65-q1', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch7', 65, 1, 'Why did Jesus use miraculous works as signs?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch7-p65-q2', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch7', 65, 2, 'What is meant by the Kingdom of God?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch7-p65-q2a', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch7', 65, NULL, 'Stimulus: Bina and Rita are brilliant and bosom friends. Besides studying they take part in extra curriculum activities in the school. After a few days, it has been noticed that Bina has started to behave unusually. He got involved with addicted friends and eventually became addicted himself. He began to neglect his studies. At one point, he realized his mistake. Though he tried to return to the right path, he could not. There was a battle between good and evil forces within Bina.
a. Whom has God nominated to save us?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch7-p65-q2b', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch7', 65, NULL, 'Stimulus: Bina and Rita are brilliant and bosom friends. Besides studying they take part in extra curriculum activities in the school. After a few days, it has been noticed that Bina has started to behave unusually. He got involved with addicted friends and eventually became addicted himself. He began to neglect his studies. At one point, he realized his mistake. Though he tried to return to the right path, he could not. There was a battle between good and evil forces within Bina.
b. Why has God created Angels?'),
  ('class7-christian-en-ch7-p65-q2c', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch7', 65, NULL, 'Stimulus: Bina and Rita are brilliant and bosom friends. Besides studying they take part in extra curriculum activities in the school. After a few days, it has been noticed that Bina has started to behave unusually. He got involved with addicted friends and eventually became addicted himself. He began to neglect his studies. At one point, he realized his mistake. Though he tried to return to the right path, he could not. There was a battle between good and evil forces within Bina.
