  ('class7-christian-en-ch7-p65-q2d', 'class7-christian-en', 'class7-christian-en-ch7', 65, NULL, 'Stimulus: Bina and Rita are brilliant and bosom friends. Besides studying they take part in extra curriculum activities in the school. After a few days, it has been noticed that Bina has started to behave unusually. He got involved with addicted friends and eventually became addicted himself. He began to neglect his studies. At one point, he realized his mistake. Though he tried to return to the right path, he could not. There was a battle between good and evil forces within Bina.
d. “There was a battle between good and evil forces within Bina”. Analyze this statement in light of the textbook.'),
