  ('class7-eft-bn-ch5-p50-q4-2', 'class7-eft-bn', 'class7-eft-bn-ch5', 50, 4, 'Answer these questions. 4. Why did many upper-class Muslims learn Arabic and Persian at that time?'),
  ('class7-eft-bn-ch5-p50-q5', 'class7-eft-bn', 'class7-eft-bn-ch5', 50, 5, 'Read about Begum Rokeya. Tick the correct answer. 5. Bhagalpur is a district in a. Bangladesh. b. West Bengal. c. Bihar.'),
