  ('class7-eft-bn-ch5-p51-q2', 'class7-eft-bn', 'class7-eft-bn-ch5', 51, 2, 'Listen again and tick the best answer. Listening text: 6. 2. Begum Rokeya set up a girls'' high school in a. Kolkata. b. Bhagalpur. c. Pairabandh.'),
