  ('class7-eft-bn-ch5-p51-q5', 'class7-eft-bn', 'class7-eft-bn-ch5', 51, 5, 'Listen again and tick the best answer. Listening text: 6. 5. Sakhawat Hossain Memorial Girls'' school is a. a private school. b. a government school. c. a muslim school.'),
