  ('class7-eft-bn-ch6-p57-q1', 'class7-eft-bn', 'class7-eft-bn-ch6', 57, 1, 'Read the poem, discuss in groups / pairs and write answers to these questions: 1. Why does the poet think that we have no time to stand and stare?'),
