  ('class7-eft-bn-ch6-p59-q4', 'class7-eft-bn', 'class7-eft-bn-ch6', 59, 4, 'Write answers to these questions. 4. Do you face any problems or difficulties in doing your leisure activities?'),
  ('class7-eft-bn-ch6-p60-q2', 'class7-eft-bn', 'class7-eft-bn-ch6', 60, 2, 'Listen to the teacher / audio and answer the following questions. Listening text: 7. Tick the best answer. 2. Julie is Zishan''s __________ sister. a. older b. younger c. cousin'),
