  ('class7-eft-bn-ch6-p60-q4', 'class7-eft-bn', 'class7-eft-bn-ch6', 60, 4, 'Listen to the teacher / audio and answer the following questions. Listening text: 7. Tick the best answer. 4. Zishan and Julie chat online. This means they talk to their friends __________. a. on the internet. b. on the telephone. c. in the classroom.'),
  ('class7-eft-bn-ch6-p60-q5', 'class7-eft-bn', 'class7-eft-bn-ch6', 60, 5, 'Listen to the teacher / audio and answer the following questions. Listening text: 7. Tick the best answer. 5. Zishan and Julie are getting bored. The underlined words mean a. making friends. b. becoming angry c. feeling tired.'),
