  ('class7-eft-bn-ch6-p64-q1', 'class7-eft-bn', 'class7-eft-bn-ch6', 64, 1, 'Tick the best answer. 1. What made Jahid and Shima excited? a. the shining of the full moon b. meeting with their cousins c. sitting on the mats d. the delicious supper'),
