  ('class7-eft-bn-ch6-p64-q3', 'class7-eft-bn', 'class7-eft-bn-ch6', 64, 3, 'Tick the best answer. 3. Zishan could not reply to Jahid''s question, "What sports do you take part in?" because a. he does not like sports. b. his school does not organize any sports. c. sports are not part of examinations. d. his parents don''t like sports.'),
  ('class7-eft-bn-ch6-p64-q4', 'class7-eft-bn', 'class7-eft-bn-ch6', 64, 4, 'Tick the best answer. 4. Julie''s aunt''s funny jokes made everybody laugh their head off. Here "laugh their head off" means laughing a. slowly. b. moving their heads. c. loudly. d. with a headache.'),
