  ('class7-eft-en-ch3-p25-q1', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch3', 25, 1, 'Match the words / phrases with their meanings. 1. hurt Meanings: (a) an area in a desert where there are water, plants, etc. (b) remove something completely (c) cut words or designs on stone or wood (d) got physical pain when someone hits you or you fall (e) deep wet sand that works like a trap. If you walk on it, you will sink into it.'),
