  ('class7-eft-en-ch4-p33-q3', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch4', 33, 3, 'Answer the following questions based on your reading of the passage: 3. What do you know about the legacy of generational struggles in Bangladesh? Write in brief.'),
