  ('class7-eft-en-ch4-p38-q1', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch4', 38, 1, 'Tick the best answers to the following multiple choice questions. 1. "The students are confused." The underlined words mean they a. can think clearly. b. cannot understand. c. are unable to speak.'),
