  ('class7-eft-en-ch5-p50-q1-3', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch5', 50, 1, 'Listen again and tick the best answer. Listening text: 6. 1. Sakhawat Hossain died in a. 1902. b. 1909. c. 1932.'),
