  ('class7-eft-en-ch5-p51-q1-2', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch5', 51, 1, 'Talk about the picture. 1. Who is the woman in the picture? [Picture: a profile portrait of a woman with her hair in a bun, wearing a high-collared dress - Helen Keller.]'),
  ('class7-eft-en-ch5-p51-q2', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch5', 51, 2, 'Listen again and tick the best answer. Listening text: 6. 2. Begum Rokeya set up a girls'' high school in a. Kolkata. b. Bhagalpur. c. Pairabandh.'),
  ('class7-eft-en-ch5-p51-q2-2', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch5', 51, 2, 'Answer the following questions. 2. Why did she move Sakhawat Memorial Girls'' High School to Kolkata?'),
  ('class7-eft-en-ch5-p51-q2-3', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch5', 51, 2, 'Talk about the picture. 2. What is she famous for? [Picture: a profile portrait of a woman with her hair in a bun, wearing a high-collared dress - Helen Keller.]'),
  ('class7-eft-en-ch5-p51-q3', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch5', 51, 3, 'Listen again and tick the best answer. Listening text: 6. 3. Begum Rokeya set up this school in memory of her a. husband. b. father. c. mother.'),
