  ('class7-eft-en-ch5-p51-q5', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch5', 51, 5, 'Listen again and tick the best answer. Listening text: 6. 5. Sakhawat Hossain Memorial Girls'' school is a. a private school. b. a government school. c. a muslim school.'),
  ('class7-eft-en-ch5-p51-q6', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch5', 51, 6, 'Listen again and tick the best answer. Listening text: 6. 6. Begum Rokeya wrote a. short stories and poems. b. novels and poems. c. novels and short stories.'),
  ('class7-eft-en-ch5-p53-q1', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch5', 53, 1, 'True or False? If false, give the correct answer. 1. Helen always helped the suffering people.'),
