  ('class7-eft-en-ch5-p53-q2-2', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch5', 53, 2, 'Answer the questions. 2. How did Helen increase her reading skills at Radcliffe College?'),
  ('class7-eft-en-ch5-p53-q3', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch5', 53, 3, 'True or False? If false, give the correct answer. 3. Anne Sullivan was a good teacher of Helen Keller.'),
