  ('class7-eft-en-ch6-p59-q3', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch6', 59, 3, 'Write answers to these questions. 3. Why do you like or dislike to do your free-time activities?'),
  ('class7-eft-en-ch6-p59-q4', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch6', 59, 4, 'Write answers to these questions. 4. Do you face any problems or difficulties in doing your leisure activities?'),
  ('class7-eft-en-ch6-p60-q2', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch6', 60, 2, 'Listen to the teacher / audio and answer the following questions. Listening text: 7. Tick the best answer. 2. Julie is Zishan''s __________ sister. a. older b. younger c. cousin'),
  ('class7-eft-en-ch6-p60-q3', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch6', 60, 3, 'Listen to the teacher / audio and answer the following questions. Listening text: 7. Tick the best answer. 3. Zishan and Julie have finished their __________ exam. a. annual b. first-terminal c. second terminal'),
  ('class7-eft-en-ch6-p60-q4', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch6', 60, 4, 'Listen to the teacher / audio and answer the following questions. Listening text: 7. Tick the best answer. 4. Zishan and Julie chat online. This means they talk to their friends __________. a. on the internet. b. on the telephone. c. in the classroom.'),
  ('class7-eft-en-ch6-p60-q5', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch6', 60, 5, 'Listen to the teacher / audio and answer the following questions. Listening text: 7. Tick the best answer. 5. Zishan and Julie are getting bored. The underlined words mean a. making friends. b. becoming angry c. feeling tired.'),
