  ('class7-eft-en-ch6-p65-q2', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch6', 65, 2, 'Look at the picture. Answer these questions. 2. Where do you think they are? [Picture: a family gathering in the yard in front of a house - an elderly grandfather sits in the middle telling a story while adults and children sit around him listening.]'),
  ('class7-eft-en-ch6-p65-q3', 'class7-eft-en', 'class7-eft-en-ch6', 65, 3, 'Look at the picture. Answer these questions. 3. Can you guess what they are doing? [Picture: a family gathering in the yard in front of a house - an elderly grandfather sits in the middle telling a story while adults and children sit around him listening.]'),
