  ('class7-english-grammar-bn-ch2-p12-q3', 'class7-english-grammar-bn', 'class7-english-grammar-bn-ch2', 12, 3, 'Look at the underlined words in the following sentences. Guess what these words are called. Client : |want to open a savings account with your bank. Nabila : It’s already late evening. You should not go out now. Bipul : Don’t worry, | will come back very soon.'),
  ('class7-english-grammar-bn-ch2-p12-q4', 'class7-english-grammar-bn', 'class7-english-grammar-bn-ch2', 12, 4, 'Look at the underlined words in the following sentences. Guess what these words are called. Client : |want to open a savings account with your bank. Liftman : Sir, which number shall | press for you? Gentleman _ : 7,if you would please!'),
