  ('class7-english-grammar-bn-ch2-p14-q8', 'class7-english-grammar-bn', 'class7-english-grammar-bn-ch2', 14, 9, 'Use a modal in the gaps of the following sentences: People are crazy about fast food these days. You ______ avoid it as much as possible.'),
