  ('class7-english-grammar-bn-ch3-p16-q1', 'class7-english-grammar-bn', 'class7-english-grammar-bn-ch3', 16, 1, 'Read the following texts and look at the underlined verbs. Tell your partner which tense it is: Arif lives in a village. His village is beside a river. It is located in the district of Gazipur.'),
