  ('class7-english-grammar-en-ch16-p143-q4', 'class7-english-grammar-en', 'class7-english-grammar-en-ch16', 143, NULL, 'Change the following sentences into indirect: The officer said to us, "Do not park here."'),
  ('class7-english-grammar-en-ch16-p143-q5', 'class7-english-grammar-en', 'class7-english-grammar-en-ch16', 143, NULL, 'Change the following sentences into indirect: Meena said to her mother, "Please wait for me."'),
  ('class7-english-grammar-en-ch16-p145-e1', 'class7-english-grammar-en', 'class7-english-grammar-en-ch16', 145, NULL, 'Change the following passage into direct speech: It was Maria’s birthday. Everybody wished her happy birthday. Her parents wished many happy returns of the day. Grandma prayed that Maria might succeed in life. Maria also prayed that Allah might bless them all.'),
  ('class7-english-grammar-en-ch16-p145-q1', 'class7-english-grammar-en', 'class7-english-grammar-en-ch16', 145, 1, 'Change the following sentences into indirect: She said, “May you succeed in the examination."'),
  ('class7-english-grammar-en-ch16-p145-q2', 'class7-english-grammar-en', 'class7-english-grammar-en-ch16', 145, 2, 'Change the following sentences into indirect: He said, "May God bless you with success."'),
  ('class7-english-grammar-en-ch16-p145-q3', 'class7-english-grammar-en', 'class7-english-grammar-en-ch16', 145, 3, 'Change the following sentences into indirect: The beggar said to him, “May you prosper in your business."'),
