  ('class7-english-grammar-en-ch19-p185-q1', 'class7-english-grammar-en', 'class7-english-grammar-en-ch19', 185, 5, 'Suppose, the British council has an advertisement in the national dailies to start an advanced English course for young learners. Write an email in 100 words to the course co-ordinator, requesting him to send you an application form:'),
