  ('class7-homescience-en-ch8-p99-q1b', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch8', 99, NULL, '[Picture-1: a milk packet, two eggs, a plate of rice and a plate of meat; Picture-2: a jar of ghee, a block of butter, a coconut and a bottle of mustard oil] b. What is the importance of digestive system?'),
  ('class7-homescience-en-ch8-p99-q1c', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch8', 99, NULL, '[Picture-1: a milk packet, two eggs, a plate of rice and a plate of meat; Picture-2: a jar of ghee, a block of butter, a coconut and a bottle of mustard oil] c. What functions are done by the foods in Picture-1?'),
  ('class7-homescience-en-ch8-p99-q1d', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch8', 99, NULL, '[Picture-1: a milk packet, two eggs, a plate of rice and a plate of meat; Picture-2: a jar of ghee, a block of butter, a coconut and a bottle of mustard oil] d. If the foods in Picture-2 are taken less than necessary, it may have harmful impact on human body? Do you agree? Give reasons in favour of your answer.'),
  ('class7-homescience-en-ch8-p99-q2', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch8', 99, 2, 'How does protein work to prevent disease in the body?'),
  ('class7-homescience-en-ch8-p99-q2a', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch8', 99, NULL, 'Tanha is restless in nature. She is ten years old. She has recovered from fever 2 to 3 days ago. But now she cannot study. She lies most of the time of the day in bed. Her mother gives her plenty of milk, pudding, vermicelli, liver, lentils to eat. a. What is digestion?'),
  ('class7-homescience-en-ch8-p99-q2b', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch8', 99, NULL, 'Tanha is restless in nature. She is ten years old. She has recovered from fever 2 to 3 days ago. But now she cannot study. She lies most of the time of the day in bed. Her mother gives her plenty of milk, pudding, vermicelli, liver, lentils to eat. b. Why does diarrhoea cause dehydration?'),
  ('class7-homescience-en-ch8-p99-q2c', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch8', 99, NULL, 'Tanha is restless in nature. She is ten years old. She has recovered from fever 2 to 3 days ago. But now she cannot study. She lies most of the time of the day in bed. Her mother gives her plenty of milk, pudding, vermicelli, liver, lentils to eat. c. How much logical are the measures takel by Tanha''s mother to regain her health? Discuss.'),
  ('class7-homescience-en-ch8-p99-q2d', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch8', 99, NULL, 'Tanha is restless in nature. She is ten years old. She has recovered from fever 2 to 3 days ago. But now she cannot study. She lies most of the time of the day in bed. Her mother gives her plenty of milk, pudding, vermicelli, liver, lentils to eat. d. How far are the foods given by her mother useful for Tanha to recover from her present condition? Explain.'),
  ('class7-homescience-en-ch8-p99-q3', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch8', 99, 3, 'What should be done to prevent anemia?'),
