  ('class7-homescience-en-ch9-p106-t4', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch9', 106, NULL, 'Make a diet plan of one day for the members of your family taking the food from 5 basic food groups. [Table: Breakfast | Lunch | Dinner]'),
  ('class7-homescience-en-ch9-p107-q1', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch9', 107, 1, 'Good source of calcium for an adult is— a. fish b. milk and milk products ood c. nuts d. pulses'),
  ('class7-homescience-en-ch9-p107-q2', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch9', 107, 2, 'Which one of the food supplies cellulose? a. beef b. green leafy vegetable c. pea nuts d. popcorn'),
  ('class7-homescience-en-ch9-p107-q3', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch9', 107, 3, 'Read the stem below and answer to the question number 3 and 4. Nafis is 13 years old. He likes to take rice with pulses. He does not want to eat fish or meat. He also does not like milk or milk products. Nafis''s body will have deficiency of- a. iodine b. riboflavin c. sucrose d. starch'),
  ('class7-homescience-en-ch9-p107-q4', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch9', 107, 4, 'Read the stem below and answer to the question number 3 and 4. Nafis is 13 years old. He likes to take rice with pulses. He does not want to eat fish or meat. He also does not like milk or milk products. With such food habit mentioned in the stem, Nafis will have– i. deficiency of calcium in his body ii. malnutrition iii. less development of brain. Which one of the following is correct? a. i and ii b. i and iii c. ii and iii d. i,ii and iii'),
  ('class7-homescience-en-ch9-p108-q1', 'class7-homescience-en', 'class7-homescience-en-ch9', 108, 1, 'What are basic food groups?'),
