Which one is correct?
a. i & ii
b. i & iii
c. ii & iii
d. i & ii & iii'),
  ('class7-islam-en-ch4-p101-t1', 'class7-islam-en', 'class7-islam-en-ch4', 101, NULL, 'Students discuss in groups the harms of snatching and the ways to prevent this evil. Then they will give a presentation in the classroom.'),
  ('class7-islam-en-ch4-p102-q1a', 'class7-islam-en', 'class7-islam-en-ch4', 102, NULL, 'Mr. ''Abdur Rahim'' lives in Dhaka. When the people of the village come to Dhaka for treatment, he arranges for their accommodation and food. His son “Ahnaf” is in the seventh grade. When his father asks him to go to the mosque for prayers, he goes to play in the field. When his mother goes to the market, he spends his time chatting with friends. ''Ahnaf'' thinks that he knows much more than the parents of this era.
a) What is called Akhlaq-e-Hamidah?'),
  ('class7-islam-en-ch4-p102-q1b', 'class7-islam-en', 'class7-islam-en-ch4', 102, NULL, 'Mr. ''Abdur Rahim'' lives in Dhaka. When the people of the village come to Dhaka for treatment, he arranges for their accommodation and food. His son “Ahnaf” is in the seventh grade. When his father asks him to go to the mosque for prayers, he goes to play in the field. When his mother goes to the market, he spends his time chatting with friends. ''Ahnaf'' thinks that he knows much more than the parents of this era.
b) Why are wealth and labor interdependent? Explain.'),
  ('class7-islam-en-ch4-p102-q1c', 'class7-islam-en', 'class7-islam-en-ch4', 102, NULL, 'Mr. ''Abdur Rahim'' lives in Dhaka. When the people of the village come to Dhaka for treatment, he arranges for their accommodation and food. His son “Ahnaf” is in the seventh grade. When his father asks him to go to the mosque for prayers, he goes to play in the field. When his mother goes to the market, he spends his time chatting with friends. ''Ahnaf'' thinks that he knows much more than the parents of this era.
c) Which quality of Akhlaq-e-Hamidah is revealed in the activities of Mr. ''Abdur Rahim''? Elucidate.'),
  ('class7-islam-en-ch4-p102-q1d', 'class7-islam-en', 'class7-islam-en-ch4', 102, NULL, 'Mr. ''Abdur Rahim'' lives in Dhaka. When the people of the village come to Dhaka for treatment, he arranges for their accommodation and food. His son “Ahnaf” is in the seventh grade. When his father asks him to go to the mosque for prayers, he goes to play in the field. When his mother goes to the market, he spends his time chatting with friends. ''Ahnaf'' thinks that he knows much more than the parents of this era.
d) Identify the aspect of Akhlaq-e-Jamimah that is revealed in the activities of ''Ahnaf'' and analyze harmfulness.'),
  ('class7-islam-en-ch4-p102-q3', 'class7-islam-en', 'class7-islam-en-ch4', 102, 3, '''Jabir'' deposited a book with his classmate ''Abir''. When he asked for it back after two days, ''Abir'' failed to return the book. His father, Mr. ''Jamir'' is a shopkeeper. He sells foreign products at a high price by putting foreign seals on the packages of domestic products.
Which moral quality is lacking in the actions of ''Abir''?
a. Altruism
b. Decency
c. Deposit/Amanah
d. Service to creation'),
  ('class7-islam-en-ch4-p102-q4', 'class7-islam-en', 'class7-islam-en-ch4', 102, 4, '''Jabir'' deposited a book with his classmate ''Abir''. When he asked for it back after two days, ''Abir'' failed to return the book. His father, Mr. ''Jamir'' is a shopkeeper. He sells foreign products at a high price by putting foreign seals on the packages of domestic products.
The Characteristic of Akhlaq-e-Jamimah observed in the activities of Mr. ''Jamir'', as a result of which he-
i. Will not be able to be a follower of the Prophet
ii. Will be deprived of the mercy of Allah Ta''ala
iii. Will become a source of hatred in the family
Which one is correct?
a. i & ii
b. i & iii
c. ii & iii
d. i & ii & iii'),
  ('class7-islam-en-ch4-p103-q1', 'class7-islam-en', 'class7-islam-en-ch4', 103, 1, 'Why should one attain ''Akhlaq-e-Hamidah''?'),
  ('class7-islam-en-ch4-p103-q2', 'class7-islam-en', 'class7-islam-en-ch4', 103, 2, 'Why is duty towards the Creator important?'),
  ('class7-islam-en-ch4-p103-q2a', 'class7-islam-en', 'class7-islam-en-ch4', 103, NULL, '''Ashiq'' has passed the SSC examination with a GPA-5. ''Ashiq''s neighbor Mr. ''Abul Mia'', after hearing the news during prayers, leaves the mosque with a dirty face. On the other hand, ''Rayhan'' lets his friend ''Fahim'' keep a calculator in the playground. When he goes home and remembers the calculator, he thinks that his friend is a thief. He decided to punish him. The next day, he accused ''Fahim'' of being a thief and beat him up in the playground.
a) What is the meaning of ''Akhlaq-e-Jamimah''?'),
  ('class7-islam-en-ch4-p103-q2b', 'class7-islam-en', 'class7-islam-en-ch4', 103, NULL, '''Ashiq'' has passed the SSC examination with a GPA-5. ''Ashiq''s neighbor Mr. ''Abul Mia'', after hearing the news during prayers, leaves the mosque with a dirty face. On the other hand, ''Rayhan'' lets his friend ''Fahim'' keep a calculator in the playground. When he goes home and remembers the calculator, he thinks that his friend is a thief. He decided to punish him. The next day, he accused ''Fahim'' of being a thief and beat him up in the playground.
