c) Which characteristic of ''Akhlaq-e-Jamimah'' is revealed in the mentality of Mr. ''Abul Mia''? Explicate.'),
  ('class7-islam-en-ch4-p103-q2d', 'class7-islam-en', 'class7-islam-en-ch4', 103, NULL, '''Ashiq'' has passed the SSC examination with a GPA-5. ''Ashiq''s neighbor Mr. ''Abul Mia'', after hearing the news during prayers, leaves the mosque with a dirty face. On the other hand, ''Rayhan'' lets his friend ''Fahim'' keep a calculator in the playground. When he goes home and remembers the calculator, he thinks that his friend is a thief. He decided to punish him. The next day, he accused ''Fahim'' of being a thief and beat him up in the playground.
