c. In scenario-1, Mr. ''Mahmud''s activities are similar to which Muslim scholar''s? Explain in the light of your textbook.'),
  ('class7-islam-en-ch5-p120-q1d', 'class7-islam-en', 'class7-islam-en-ch5', 120, NULL, 'Scenario-1: During the dry season, the canals in Bhasanchar Union dry up. This causes difficulties for the farmers in their cultivation. Mr. ''A'', a wealthy man of the area, installs ten deep tube wells. When there is a shortage in the village due to drought, Mr. ''A'' distributes twenty kilograms of rice to each family.
