  ('class7-science-en-ch2-p24-q2c', 'class7-science-en', 'class7-science-en-ch2', 24, NULL, '[Figure: N — diagram of a plant covered by an upturned pot; M — diagram of a carrot with roots] c. Explain why the figure M is red in real life even though it is a root.'),
