  ('class7-science-en-ch3-p34-q1b', 'class7-science-en', 'class7-science-en-ch3', 34, NULL, '[Figure: X — jointed stem with nodes and roots; Y — potato with eyes; Z — elongated swollen root] b) Explain how reproduction occurr through leaves in bryophyllum.'),
  ('class7-science-en-ch3-p34-q1c', 'class7-science-en', 'class7-science-en-ch3', 34, NULL, '[Figure: X — jointed stem with nodes and roots; Y — potato with eyes; Z — elongated swollen root] c) Which type of stem is shown in the figure X?'),
  ('class7-science-en-ch3-p34-q1d', 'class7-science-en', 'class7-science-en-ch3', 34, NULL, '[Figure: X — jointed stem with nodes and roots; Y — potato with eyes; Z — elongated swollen root] d) What are the different characters are found in Plant Y and Z even though they are cultivated in the same environment? Analyse.'),
  ('class7-science-en-ch3-p34-q2', 'class7-science-en', 'class7-science-en-ch3', 34, 2, 'Explain the body of a cactus is stem or leaf- explain.'),
  ('class7-science-en-ch3-p34-q2a', 'class7-science-en', 'class7-science-en-ch3', 34, NULL, '[Figure: M — tree base with prop/support roots; R — climbing vine with tendrils; N — plant with clustered roots and bulbs] a. What is an offset?'),
  ('class7-science-en-ch3-p34-q2b', 'class7-science-en', 'class7-science-en-ch3', 34, NULL, '[Figure: M — tree base with prop/support roots; R — climbing vine with tendrils; N — plant with clustered roots and bulbs] b. Why pitcher plant is called insect trap Explain.'),
  ('class7-science-en-ch3-p34-q2c', 'class7-science-en', 'class7-science-en-ch3', 34, NULL, '[Figure: M — tree base with prop/support roots; R — climbing vine with tendrils; N — plant with clustered roots and bulbs] c. Explain the reason for the position of the part marked in the plant shown in the figure above.'),
  ('class7-science-en-ch3-p34-q2d', 'class7-science-en', 'class7-science-en-ch3', 34, NULL, '[Figure: M — tree base with prop/support roots; R — climbing vine with tendrils; N — plant with clustered roots and bulbs] d. Compare the plants R and N.'),
  ('class7-science-en-ch3-p34-q3', 'class7-science-en', 'class7-science-en-ch3', 34, 3, 'Mention the reasons why leaves are modified.'),
